{"seq":2,"at":"2026-10-20","kind":"edited","target":{"type":"article","id":"a0436"},"reason":"Rewritten by the merge to take in the printed cards' questions.","by":"merge film-media/film","ref":"quiz-archive/runs/tp-ingest/decisions/film-media__film.g4.json","changes":[{"field":"bodyEn","diff":[["=",166],["-","icon;"],["+","icon."],["=",1],["+","„Goodfellas“ follows the real gangster Henry Hill (Ray Liotta) and his crew: De Niro's hijacker Jimmy Conway, the made man Billy Batts, beaten to death for an insult, and the getaway driver „Stacks“ Edwards, played by the young Samuel L. Jackson. In „Casino“ (1995) De Niro is Sam „Ace“ Rothstein, who runs the fictional Las Vegas casino Tangiers for the Mob – named after the Moroccan port city of Tangier and modelled on the real Stardust. "],["=",10],["-","him"],["+","Scorsese"],["=",474],["+"," „The Big Lebowski“ became the cult film of the group: Jeff Bridges plays Jeffrey „The Dude“ Lebowski, a bowling slacker in a bathrobe who drinks White Russians, and his calm „The Dude abides“ has been adopted by fans who hold festivals in his honour."],["=",324]]},{"field":"bodyDe","diff":[["=",134],["-","„GoodFellas“"],["+","„GoodFellas"],["=",1],["+","– Drei Jahrzehnte in der Mafia“ "],["=",24],["-","Ikone;"],["+","Ikone."],["=",1],["+","„GoodFellas“ folgt dem realen Gangster Henry Hill (Ray Liotta) und seiner Bande: De Niros Lkw-Räuber Jimmy Conway, dem Mafioso Billy Batts, der wegen einer Beleidigung totgeschlagen wird, und dem Fluchtwagenfahrer „Stacks“ Edwards, gespielt vom jungen Samuel L. Jackson. In „Casino“ (1995) ist De Niro Sam „Ace“ Rothstein, der für die Mafia das fiktive Kasino Tangiers in Las Vegas führt – benannt nach der marokkanischen Hafenstadt Tanger und dem echten Stardust nachempfunden. "],["=",12],["-","ihm"],["+","Scorsese"],["=",466],["+"," „The Big Lebowski“ wurde zum Kultfilm der Gruppe: Jeff Bridges spielt Jeffrey „The Dude“ Lebowski, einen Bowling-Faulpelz im Bademantel, der White Russians trinkt, und sein gelassenes „Der Dude packt das“ („The Dude abides“) haben Fans übernommen, die ihm zu Ehren eigene Festivals feiern."],["=",324]]}]},
